{"ref":"BDB, דִּישֹׁן²","hw":"דִּישֹׁן²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דִּישֹׁן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a son of Seir <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּשׁוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:21\" href=\"/Genesis.36.21\">Gn 36:21</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּישֹׁן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.38\">1 Ch 1:38</a>;<br><strong>2.</strong>  a son of Anah & grandson of Seir <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּשֹׁ֑ן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:25\" href=\"/Genesis.36.25\">Gn 36:25</a> cf. v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:30\" href=\"/Genesis.36.30\">30</a> so also v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:26\" href=\"/Genesis.36.26\">26</a> (for <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּישָׁן</span> q.v.) = <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּישׁוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:41\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.41\">1 Ch 1:41</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.42\">42</a>, cf. also foll.","next":"BDB, דִּישָׁן","prev":"BDB, דִּישֹׁן"}